## Security, Scale, and Business Value

**Time: 1 min**

The solution supports four responsible AI guardrails.

First, **PII and data privacy**, through multi-pattern PII detection.

Second, **grounding and citations**, by checking answers against enterprise source documents.

Third, **auditability**, by storing scores, thresholds, verdicts, remediation history, timestamps, and operator evidence.

Fourth, **domain boundaries**, by rejecting role overrides, unauthorized approvals, and unsupported responses.

The release policy is deterministic: groundedness must meet the threshold, toxicity must pass, PII protection must pass, category floors must pass, and critical failures must be zero.

The solution can help **AI deployment teams, compliance teams, risk teams, security teams, and business owners**.

